{"id": "34427", "title": "爱情实习讲师", "author": "辰晞", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34427.htm", "intro": "这女人的神经真的很大条！他都已经暗示得这么明显了，她竟然还猜不到他总裁的身分，不仅呆呆地以为他是啥总裁助理，还很令人喷饭的告诉他一个大秘密－－“跟你说喔，总裁听说很厉害……”嗯哼，这又不是什么大秘密……“因为总裁跟种猪一样优秀！”种猪！？她竟然把他比喻成种猪？他的额头顿时冒出三条斜线－－ 嗯哼，他现在开始十分期待，当她知道他的身分时，表情会有多“厉害”了－", "base": "files/article/html/34/34427", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2185454.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2185455.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2185456.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2185457.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2185458.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2185459.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2185460.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2185461.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2185462.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2185463.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2185464.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2185465.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2185466.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2185467.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2185468.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2185469.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2185470.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2185471.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2185472.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2185473.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2185474.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2185475.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2185476.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2185477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页", "file": "2185478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第26页